# Release safety (30)

- Prefer GitOps pull requests over direct Kubernetes/Terraform mutation from Cursor.
- Block `kubectl apply`, `helm upgrade`, `terraform apply`, force-push, and curl|sh patterns via hooks.
- Production cloud CLI actions from the agent are prohibited — use controlled release workflows.
- First constrained mutation remains grant-bound non-prod GitHub PR create (`github-write`) until dual-approval production path is certified.
